Cloud-Kernel-BBRv3 licensing index

This repository contains project-authored material together with Linux-derived
and other third-party material. No single license applies to every file, and
this index does not relicense any third-party work.

1. Project-authored software and documentation

Original Cloud-Kernel-BBRv3 automation, configuration fragments, packaging
integration, and documentation are dedicated under the Unlicense where the
project controls the relevant rights and where a file does not state another
license. The complete text is in:

    LICENSES/Unlicense.txt

This grant does not apply to the Linux kernel, Debian or XanMod patches, BBR
implementations, AmneziaWG, imported source, generated source trees, or other
third-party and derived material.

2. Project artwork

The project-owned artwork `Cloudy Kernel.png` is made available under Creative
Commons CC0 1.0 Universal. The complete legal text is in:

    LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt

3. Linux-derived and third-party material

The built Linux kernel is distributed under GPL-2.0-only as a whole, while
individual files may use GPL-2.0-compatible licenses identified by their own
SPDX tags and notices. Imported modules, patch collections, and other
third-party material remain under their respective upstream terms. Included
reference license texts are in `LICENSES/`; exact component provenance and
scope are recorded in `NOTICE`.

Package-level `GPL-2.0-only` metadata describes the distributed Linux kernel
package. It does not replace or override compatible per-file licenses.

See `NOTICE` before redistributing source or binaries. The prepared source
archive published with each release preserves the applied source, upstream
license material, build provenance, and this project license bundle.
